<div class="matrix-note">
  <b>Reading rule:</b>
  this matrix maps relationships, access and timing; it does not assign roles.
  The People section owns participant expertise.
  Citizen Science owns school and monitoring-network design.
  Tourism / River Economy owns the economic model and mechanisms.
  Guardians owns mandate-bearing participation.
  Legal owns legal allies and legal strategy.
  The semantic chips above only show where deeper work naturally belongs;
  they do not imply that a person or organization has accepted that role.
</div>

